---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { chapters } from '../../data/chapters';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<Layout title="Learning path">
  <p class="eyebrow">Learn / DMS V0</p>
  <h1>Ask, define, experiment, interpret.</h1>
  <p class="lead">Use one fictional monitoring problem to connect engineering intent, structured definitions and qualified evidence.</p>
  <ol>
    {chapters.map(chapter => <li><h2><a href={`${base}learn/${chapter.path}/`}>{chapter.title}</a></h2><p>{chapter.summary}</p></li>)}
  </ol>
  <p>These lessons retain one ideal circular sensor. They do not establish real-world sensing performance.</p>
</Layout>
<style>li { margin: 2rem 0; } ol { padding-left: 1.5rem; }</style>
